{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738650/extras/457ca2262b3af328e3f19f06e550c65d.poster.avif?t=1772727857\" width=614 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738650/extras/457ca2262b3af328e3f19f06e550c65d.webm?t=1772727857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738650/extras/457ca2262b3af328e3f19f06e550c65d.mp4?t=1772727857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Seers Isle</strong> is an interactive graphic novel, set in a fantasy version of medieval northern Europe, where your choices impact the fate of a group of characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story:</h2><br><i>\u201cThe island\u2026 It was my prison.<br>For ages, I roamed the land, helpless, looking for a way out...<br>... And then, they arrived.\u201d</i><br><br>A group of shaman apprentices set foot on the shores of a sacred island to be initiated to magic. <br>As they progress through the wilderness, looking for the \u201cSeers\u201d, their spirit-guides, they realize they\u2019re not alone.<br>Who is this strange horned woman they are seeing in their dreams?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738650/extras/615fb451b5565c1265c2ed3af064aad8.webp?t=1772727857\" width=620 height=40 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore the island through a diverse group of characters, depicted in a <strong>gorgeous European comic book art style</strong>.<br></li><li> <strong>Every choice matters</strong>. Each decision you make slightly alters the mood and personality of the main character as well as her relationship with the rest of the group.<br></li><li> A <strong>huge amount of content</strong>: with each playthrough, discover a novel-sized adventure and a slice of the hundreds of hand-drawn images created for the game.<br></li><li> An <strong>immersive and finely crafted soundtrack</strong>: the music adapts and shifts according to your choices and the mood of each scene.<br></li><li> Try out our <strong>dynamic dialog system</strong>: read the story like a comic book.<br></li><li> <strong>High replayability</strong>: choose your soulmate and discover the outcome of your decisions through multiple story paths and endings.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ffffaa90ec15aa28eb2eede6f7e63f86e39bd084.jpg","localized_name":"The Crow Takes Flight","name":"The Crow Takes Flight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/738650/ffffaa90ec15aa28eb2eede6f7e63f86e39bd084.jpg"},{"icon":"e07287db46481f790690ea0afa58de8dfac37d68.jpg","localized_name":"The Horned Templar","name":"The Horned Templar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/738650/e07287db46481f790690ea0afa58de8dfac37d68.jpg"},{"icon":"134f00d41ae1e1c2ccc8cd4adbf848b095e72e8b.jpg","localized_name":"The Cub Becomes a Wolf","name":"The Cub Becomes a Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/738650/134f00d41ae1e1c2ccc8cd4adbf848b095e72e8b.jpg"},{"icon":"bf3319c0b42903958ba43aa1abfa88937bf2fd70.jpg","localized_name":"The Morrigan","name":"The Morrigan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/738650/bf3319c0b42903958ba43aa1abfa88937bf2fd70.jpg"},{"icon":"c5da94f5728873ba1ad33119108daf34345d79f6.jpg","localized_name":"Ashes to ashes","name":"Ashes to ashes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/738650/c5da94f5728873ba1ad33119108daf34345d79f6.jpg"},{"icon":"a7b256121c42424add46f83a7903ed408b91ada9.jpg","localized_name":"Broken Heart","name":"Broken Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a